#
# This files is intended to set the VIDEO_CARDS use flags. The official gentoo
# wiki provides some guidance on how to set the video cards depending on the
# graphic card(s) in use. As a rule of thumb:
#
# | GPU    | FLAGS           |
# | ------ | --------------- |
# | AMD    | amdgpu radeonsi |
# | Nvidia | nouveau         |
# | Intel  | intel           |
# | QEMU   | virtgl          |
#
# Wiki: https://wiki.gentoo.org/wiki/Handbook:AMD64/Installation/Base
#
# NOTE: From experiance, installing only for amdgpu + radeonsi seems to have an
#       issue where libdrm fails to build without the radeon option. In this
#       case, the we just add radon to x11-libs/libdrm. But there may be other
#       quirks such as these.

*/* VIDEO_CARDS: -* amdgpu radeonsi radeon intel nouveau virgl
